{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30583","headline":"和主司王起 · 丁棱","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公心独立副天心，三辖春闱冠古今。\n兰署门生皆入室，莲峰太守别知音。\n同升翰苑时名重，遍历朝端主意深。\n新有受恩江海客，坐听朝夕继爲霖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丁棱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30583.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30583","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}